  "body": "Hello lovely humans,\n\n[eslint-plugin-react](https://www.npmjs.com/package/eslint-plugin-react) just published its new version 6.7.1.\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      State\n    </th>\n    <td>\n      Failing tests :rotating_light:\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Dependency\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      eslint-plugin-react\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      New version\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      6.7.1\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <th align=left>\n      Type\n    </td>\n    <td>\n      devDependency\n    </td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\nThis version is **covered** by your **current version range** and after updating it in your project **the build went from success to failure**.\n\nAs eslint-plugin-react is “only” a devDependency of this project it **might not break production or downstream projects**, but “only” your build or test tools – **preventing new deploys or publishes**.\n\nI recommend you give this issue a high priority. I’m sure you can resolve this :muscle:\n\n\nOf course this could just be a false positive, caused by a flaky test suite, or third parties that are currently broken or unavailable, but that would be another problem I’d recommend working on.\n\n\nDo you have any ideas how I could improve these pull requests? Did I report anything you think isn’t right?\nAre you unsure about how things are supposed to work?\n\nThere is a collection of [frequently asked questions](https://greenkeeper.io/faq.html) and while I’m just a bot, there is a group of people who are happy to teach me new things. [Let them know](https://github.com/greenkeeperio/greenkeeper/issues/new).\n\nGood luck with your project :sparkles:\n\nYou rock!\n\n:palm_tree:\n\n---\n[GitHub Release](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/releases/tag/v6.7.1)\n\n<h3>Fixed</h3>\n\n<ul>\n<li>Fix <code>jsx-tag-spacing</code> crash when options object isn't passed (<a href=\"https://urls.greenkeeper.io/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/issues/955\">#955</a> <a href=\"https://urls.greenkeeper.io/daltones\" class=\"user-mention\">@daltones</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n\n---\nThe new version differs by 22 commits .\n\n- [`af323d5`](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/commit/af323d55cde75d536a96a99688808626613dec09) <code>Update CHANGELOG and bump version</code>\n- [`c537015`](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/commit/c537015e328bbe012915867bf93fd50c1f2ff352) <code>Add additional test for jsx-tag-spacing</code>\n- [`6da5807`](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/commit/6da5807218b97b4924c938d5bb0ce8356b98dfa8) <code>Fix jsx-tag-spacing crash when options object isn't passed (fixes #955)</code>\n- [`de9a357`](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/commit/de9a357c57768020b855883797a8db66b817770b) <code>Fix `jsx-tag-spacing` crash when options object isn't passed</code>\n- [`5952dbf`](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/commit/5952dbf2d17cc02f885f657f8cb9d00aa53869f1) <code>Update CHANGELOG and bump version</code>\n- [`17acf24`](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/commit/17acf242fa32973e67062212a2dd3f8c06611d1f) <code>Update dependencies</code>\n- [`874a3e3`](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/commit/874a3e329f4410f6fa6f0a71d8dccc02ea453647) <code>Fix jsx-wrap-multilines ternaries handling (fixes #916)</code>\n- [`fe5594b`](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/commit/fe5594bd5264e939924552e6403a4e171793f40f) <code>Fix no-danger-with-children crash with spread on global variables (fixes #921)</code>\n- [`1df6118`](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/commit/1df61185f289daec908f5f21b96e13b01d7a7e9a) <code>Merge pull request #953 from everdimension/default-skipshapeprops-enable</code>\n- [`9921674`](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/commit/99216742bc4acb28eaee318c403310cb67d0b47c) <code>Fix some links in CHANGELOG</code>\n- [`231acd9`](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/commit/231acd9cff67248509c243a24261189851c0e7af) <code>Fix jsx-indent for arrays in jsx (fixes #947)</code>\n- [`40882e5`](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/commit/40882e57cb9f0a709788e6ef85b8c8bc9d59033f) <code>Add more test to jsx-indent for multiline ternaries</code>\n- [`2fb1d37`](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/commit/2fb1d37700092e117b292325bb1958fb30103877) <code>Fix jsx-indent on multiline ternary</code>\n- [`e60921c`](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/commit/e60921c89febbbc093095b0546f91195149b830d) <code>Fix jsx-indent for parenthesized ternary (fixes #945)</code>\n- [`2cd6e91`](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/commit/2cd6e916a669d3601868a1122f0ae3d61ff473a4) <code>skipShapeProps should be enabled by default until it works properly;</code>\n\n\nThere are 22 commits in total. See the [full diff](https://github.com/yannickcr/eslint-plugin-react/compare/cad882b6f9dbb13987785a9f51229b721cce4ea6...af323d55cde75d536a96a99688808626613dec09).\n\n---\nThis pull request was created by [greenkeeper.io](https://greenkeeper.io/).\n\n<sub>Tired of seeing this sponsor message? :zap: `greenkeeper upgrade`</sub>",
